&lt;/font&gt;" parent="source" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B9C6D3;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#172C43;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;spacing=12;align=left;spacingLeft=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="24" y="641.0" width="742" height="114.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="contract" value="" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B9C6D3;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#172C43;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;spacing=12;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1010" width="1894.0079999999998" height="108" /></mxCell><mxCell id="config" value="&lt;b&gt;BUILD INPUT&lt;/b&gt;  EXTERNALSRC는 zephyrproject이며 실제 application은 Arm apps/sample이다. QVP는 Arm module의 작업 복사본에 제한 패치를 적용하고 HSOC board 및 별도 pfdi-tx-irq module을 추가한다." parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#172C43;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;spacing=12;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#172C43;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1019" width="1854.0079999999998" height="46" /></mxCell><mxCell id="artifact" value="&lt;b&gt;ARTIFACT / CONSUMER&lt;/b&gt;  zephyr-demos-cl1.bin → SI1 서명 이미지; Linux remoteproc은 독립 부팅된 CL1에 attach" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#172C43;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;spacing=12;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#172C43;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1068" width="1854.0079999999998" height="38" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="Zephyr kernel, Arm Safety Island module, HSOC board는 서로 다른 소유 구역이다. HSOC sample이 기본 application으로 선택되는 것은 아니다." parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#172C43;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;spacing=12;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spa